-- The summary, 1: running the erosion database — collecting the data,
-- cleaning it and the runs for 2002–2006 — costs 1.6 million shekels, VAT
-- not included; the State pays half, the organisations the other half.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1
`the cost of running the erosion database for 2002–2006, before VAT` MEANS 1600000
`the State's share of the erosion database's cost` MEANS 50%

`the State's half of the erosion database` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `pay half the cost of running the erosion database for 2002–2006`

#ASSERT `the cost of running the erosion database for 2002–2006, before VAT` TIMES `the State's share of the erosion database's cost` EQUALS 800000

-- 2: at the organisations' request, their half is deducted from the sums to
-- be passed to them for 2007 under clauses the parties agree in writing, by
-- the Ministry of Education's accountant, during 2007, in coordination with
-- them.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2
`deducting the organisations' half of the erosion database` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `deduct the organisations' half of the erosion database's cost from the sums due them for 2007`

-- 3: (א) the Treasury, ארגון המורים and הסתדרות המורים may each ask the
-- database for data and simulations, for the erosion check only; (ב) a
-- copy of the request goes to the other side at once; (ג) the other side
-- may object, within 3 working days of getting it, where the request is
-- not about erosion; (ד) with no written objection within the 3 days, the
-- database passes the results to all three at the same time.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_a akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_b akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_c akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3__subpara_d
`working days to object to an erosion database request` MEANS 3

`a copy of an erosion database request` MEANS
    PARTY `the Treasury`
    MUST  `send a copy of an erosion database request to the other side`

GIVEN `the request is about erosion` IS A BOOLEAN
      `working days since the other side got it` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the other side may object to the erosion database request` `the request is about erosion` `working days since the other side got it` IF
        NOT `the request is about erosion`
    AND `working days since the other side got it` AT MOST `working days to object to an erosion database request`

GIVEN `a written objection was given within the days` IS A BOOLEAN
      `working days since the other side got it` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the erosion database passes the results` `a written objection was given within the days` `working days since the other side got it` IF
        NOT `a written objection was given within the days`
    AND `working days since the other side got it` GREATER THAN `working days to object to an erosion database request`

#ASSERT `the other side may object to the erosion database request` FALSE 3
#ASSERT NOT `the other side may object to the erosion database request` TRUE 1
#ASSERT `the erosion database passes the results` FALSE 4
